2026-10-22T10:17:03.8300820Z unifdef is keg-only, which means it was not symlinked into /opt/homebrew,
2026-10-22T10:17:03.8302320Z because macOS already provides this software and installing another version in
2026-10-22T10:17:03.8307640Z parallel can cause all kinds of trouble.
2026-10-22T10:17:03.8308590Z 
2026-10-22T10:17:03.8309840Z If you need to have unifdef first in your PATH, run:
2026-10-22T10:17:03.8311460Z   echo 'export PATH="/opt/homebrew/opt/unifdef/bin:$PATH"' >> /Users/runner/.bash_profile
