2026-10-22T10:17:03.8314640Z CLANG_CONFIG_FILE_SYSTEM_DIR: /opt/homebrew/etc/clang
2026-10-22T10:17:03.8315740Z CLANG_CONFIG_FILE_USER_DIR:   ~/.config/clang
2026-10-22T10:17:03.8316440Z 
2026-10-22T10:17:03.8316890Z LLD and LLDB are now provided in separate formulae:
2026-10-22T10:17:03.8319980Z   brew install lld
2026-10-22T10:17:03.8320660Z   brew install lldb
2026-10-22T10:17:03.8321060Z 
